<title>JAPAN: Japan's Feb household spending up 0.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan's Feb household spending up 0.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's household spending in February rose 0.1 percent in real terms from a year earlier to an average of 301,090 yen per household, the government's Management and Coordination Agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The following is a breakdown of year-on-year percentage changes in household spending in real and nominal terms:</p>
<p>						Feb		   Jan</p>
<p>					 Real   Nominal    Real   Nominal</p>
<p> Overall household spending    +0.1    +0.4	-0.3    +0.1</p>
<p>(average 301,090 yen)</p>
<p> Spending by wage earners	+1.2    +1.5	+2.7    +3.1</p>
<p>(average 323,956 yen)</p>
</text>
